CharacterBuffCategory<public><localizes>:message = "Custom character buffs / ability grants"
BuffSpeedToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Multiplier on the walk / run speed cap (1.5 for 1.5x). Stacked buffs multiply. Default 1"
BuffJumpToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Multiplier on the upward speed at the moment of jumping (height changes roughly with the square). Stacked buffs multiply. Default 1"
BuffGravityToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Multiplier on gravity (0.5 for a floaty fall, 0 for no falling). Stacked buffs multiply. Default 1"
BuffOverrideSideStyleToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, sets the walk component's side-input style to SideStyle while stacked (e.g. an effect that switches to crab walk or turning in place on pickup). With several stacked, the last one wins; when all are removed, the walk component's base returns. Default off"
BuffSideStyleToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "With OverrideSideStyle on, the side-input style while stacked. Turn turns toward the movement direction, Strafe moves sideways while facing forward (crab walk), TankTurn turns in place with side input and moves forward / back along the body's facing. Default Strafe"
BuffActiveOnBeginToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, applies from start without waiting for the activation signal. When off, from the activation signal to the deactivation signal (leave it off inside a PickupSystem effect prefab or a loadout). Default off"
MoveGrantAirJumpsToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Number added to the air jump count (1 for a double jump). Gained in the air, the extra jumps are usable right away. Default 1"
MoveGrantDashToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, lets a body whose dash component has RequiresGrant on dash (keep the dash component and its input on the body). Default off"
